VITE_APP_TITLE='fire-hydro'
VITE_APP_LONG_TITLE='How Wildfires Threaten U.S. Water Supplies'
VITE_APP_DESCRIPTION='Communities across the United States and the globe rely on clean water flowing from forested watersheds. But these water source areas can be impacted by the effects of wildfire. In order to help water providers and land managers prepare for impacts from wildfire on our water supplies, the U.S. Geological Survey is working to measure and predict post-fire water quality and quantity.'
VITE_APP_GITHUB_REPOSITORY_LINK='https://github.com/DOI-USGS/fire-hydro'
VITE_APP_S3_PROD_URL='https://water.usgs.gov/vizlab/'
VITE_APP_ASSET_URL='vizlab'
